Error: Jet.UnusedImport: Import `unused_mod` is never used.
  --> Tests/UILint/UnusedImport/unused_import_module_owners.jet:12:5
    |
 12 |     unused_mod: core.files
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: An unused import adds a name and dependency to the file without contributing to checked code.
 Fix: Remove the import, or rename `unused_mod` to `_unused_mod` when the import is intentionally kept.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnusedImport
